// aljakdy(m), almalydy(m), alsam … alsalar, almasa(m)); D. Gray, "A Short Descriptive Grammar of Turkmen" (SIL, 2011:
// participles alýan, almaýan, alan, almadyk, aljak, almajak; almaga, almagy, almagyň, okamagym … okamaklary;
